        <member-data valType="String">{"DisplayText": "Message", "MessageType": "Error", "MessageCategory": "None", "Summary": "Model information is incompatible with incoming mesh.Fluent failed to apply some mesh operations", "Details": """Following zones were missing in the mesh:
toppt1 ,toppt2 ,outpt2 ,outpt1 ,outdomaintube ,cldompt1 ,cldompt2 ,walldomainpt1 ,walldomainpt2
Following new zones were found in the mesh:
outdomain2 ,outdomain1 ,lateral ,cldomain ,walldomain
